### API home
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/

### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Create a student (use dummy data)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Asha Kumar",
  "date_of_birth": "2005-04-12",
  "email": "asha@example.com",
  "phone": "9000000001",
  "course": "ECE",
  "address": "Hassan, Karnataka",
  "enrollment_date": "2024-08-01"
}

### Create another student
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ravi Shetty",
  "date_of_birth": "2006-09-24",
  "phone": "9000000002",
  "course": "CSE"
}

### List students
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/students

### Filter by name/course
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/students?name=asha
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/students?course=ECE

### Find students born after 2005
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/students?born_after_year=2005

### Get student ID 1
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/students/1

### Partially update student ID 1
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9111111111",
  "address": "Bengaluru, Karnataka"
}

### Replace all details for student ID 1 (send required fields)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Asha Kumar",
  "date_of_birth": "2005-04-12",
  "email": "asha.updated@example.com",
  "phone": "9111111111",
  "course": "ECE",
  "address": "Bengaluru, Karnataka",
  "enrollment_date": "2024-08-01"
}

### Ask the optional local AI (requires Ollama running and model installed)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/students/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How many students are there?"
}

### Delete student ID 1
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/students/1
